Cell["\<\
Figure 10.2  Selective compartmentalisation: a ternary (A, B, solvent) free \
energy in which two mutually-repelling solutes form an A-rich and a B-rich \
condensate \[LongDash] each client partitions into the droplet it binds best, \
the physical basis of organelle identity.\
\>", "Text",
 CellMargins->{{70, 70}, {2, 14}},
 FontSize->11,
